SUMMARY:West Asheville Wednesdays @ One World (WOW)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261216T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261216T163000
UID:1b28cc18fa488be5bb9fb9b7a97c23a2@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/WOW%20Every%203rd%20%20Wednesday_20260630153134537718.png
DESCRIPTION:Join your West Asheville neighbors each month for our “Wedne
 sdays @ One World” (WOW) hosted by One World Brewing on Haywood. Each WO
 W includes ample time to socialize and network with fellow Democrats and p
 rogressive unaffiliated voters\, political influencers\, elected officials
