DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261218T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261218T210000
SUMMARY:Come Together - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Bob Swoap
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, December 18th\nEvening
  Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\n
 Guest DJ Bob Swoap \\| Support Facilitator Kristikka\n\nIntention: Come To
 gether\n\nCome together and remember that we belong to each other.\nMusic 
 and dance offer a parallel: different instruments\, different voices\, dif
 ferent rhythms. None needs to disappear for harmony to emerge.\n\nAn invit
 ation:\nCan I be fully myself in the presence of others?\nCan I allow othe
 rs to be fully themselves?\nCan I feel the beauty of belonging to somethin
 g larger while remaining entirely myself?\n\n## About Bob Swoap\n\nBob cra
 fts journeys that invite dancers to deeply connect: with themselves\, othe
 rs\, nature\, and the music. He layers genres and world rhythms into an em
 otionally engaging set. At Warren Wilson College -- where he is professor 
 of psychology and expressive arts therapy -- Bob facilitates ecstatic danc
 e as a part of the community wellness program\, bringing a grounded\, expe
 rienced presence to the floor. Favorite place to dance: outside at the WWC
  Pavilion.\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm 
 up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will
  be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. 
 \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away
  for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe nee
 d volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[ht
 tps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam
 10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxg
 UcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTAN
 T ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle
 . Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agr
 eements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExM
 FZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1
 XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA
 )\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that move
 s in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a lovi
 ng community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy 
 community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and 
 community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLo
 cation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317471734/
