SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261128T072759Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T123000
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, December 20th\n1st Dan
 ce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance
  Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilita
 tor Kristikka\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Kristikka\n\nKristikka loves c
 reating a sacred container that takes you on an inward journey utilizing r
 hythm to move us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down into stillness an
 d integration. She feels that movement is medicine\, weaving intention and
  a rich blend of world beats where it’s possible to be with what is and 
 open to what wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can find her dance mix
 es here:[ ](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka) [http://soundcloud.com/dj-
 kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Plea
 se note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Open
 ing Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time t
 o ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or 
 name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registratio
 n Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance fo
 r free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.or
 g/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=Iw
 ZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3OD
 gyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_a
 em_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close 
 at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENIN
 G CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dan
 ce/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkE
 DIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3EL
 hDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement 
 Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to b
 e their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim ar
 e to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by
  hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 5
