X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Haywood County Walking Meetup Group": "https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/events/317537595/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_haywood_county_walking_meetup_group
X-SOURCE:Haywood County Walking Group
UID:event_317537595@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261128T072811Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T153000
SUMMARY:Walk the Moon Tree Way at Haywood Community College
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nHaywood Community College
  has long been known for having a tree grown from a seed taken on a moon m
 ission. Now there are two trees near each other. We will be watching for t
 hose trees when we walk at HCC on December 20.\n\nTo get to Moon Tree Way 
 from our start point\, we will go counterclockwise on the Bobcat Trail unt
 il we get to the Bird and Butterfly Garden. From there we will walk past I
 ronwood\, past the Moon Trees\, and then go behind the Dahlia Garden. From
  there we will rejoin Bobcat Trail to finish our first loop. Our second lo
 op will be totally on the Bobcat Trail. All together\, it isn't over 3 mil
 es. Part of the walk is on pavement\, part on well-groomed trail\, and par
 t on not-as-well groomed trail. There is some small elevation change.\n\nA
 s you enter the campus from Jones Cove Road\, go to the first parking lot 
 on the left. We will gather there and then head out.\n\nBe sure to dress f
 or the weather\; even though it is December consider a hat and sunscreen. 
 I'm going to wear tennis shoes\, unless it has rained a lot recently (in w
 hich case\, I will wear light hiking boots). I plan to bring one walking s
 tick\, just in case. As always\, you are urged to bring plenty of water an
 d a protein snack. Dogs are welcome. Trail strollers should not have any p
 roblem. There are no bathrooms available that afternoon\, so take care of 
 such needs before you arrive.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/317537595/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261122T141622Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T141622Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
