SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ CJ O'Reilly (DJ SeigeA)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, December 27th\n1st Dan
 ce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance
  Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilita
 tor CJ O'Reilly (DJ SeigeA)\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About CJ O'Reilly\n\nC
 J O'Reilly has been creating ecstatic dance waves for the Asheville commun
 ity since 2014. Their eclectic mix of musical styles beckons dancers into 
 new patterns of movement and expression through diverse time signatures an
 d instrumentation\, and a wide range of musical and emotive qualities. CJ'
 s waves explore high peaks\, beautiful vistas\, juicy lowlands and the pro
 found reflective stillness of tranquil water. CJ's dance waves are pre-pro
 duced and refined through the body and ears of a dancer and audiophile.\nF
 ind more of DJ SeigeA's dance waves at [https://dj.seigea.com](https://dj.
 seigea.com)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Wa
 rm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late w
 ill be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure containe
 r. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned a
 way for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe 
 need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n
 [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemove
 mentcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmF
 lam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71U
 KxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPOR
 TANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening cir
 cle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective 
 agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://
 ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZB
 ExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8q
 UH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4Y
 AfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that m
 oves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a l
 oving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healt
 hy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal a
 nd community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\
 nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor
 !
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317471700/
