DESCRIPTION:Cost: $15-$25 | Recurring on selected dates. Step into the mag
 ic of the season at the Holiday Ice Rink at Asheville Yards - the destinat
 ion for ice skating in Asheville\, NC. Glide across our real\, outdoor ice
