BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/intro-to-stargazing-jan/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270109T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270109T180000
DTSTAMP:20261117T211333Z
CREATED:20261117T211333Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261117T211333Z
UID:1778780020269-1799506800-1799517600@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Introduction to Stargazing
DESCRIPTION:Introduction to Stargazing\nwith Steve Martin \nSaturday\, January 9  |  3 – 6 pm Classroom\, 7:30 – 8:30 pm Stargazing \nBRN – Elective \nRegister Here!\nDiscover the wonders of the night sky in this beginner-friendly course combining classroom learning and outdoor stargazing. Learn to find stars\, constellations\, and planets using simple tools\, and get tips for observing with binoculars and telescopes. No experience or equipment needed! \nThis program will take place both inside the classroom and outside\, following easy trails and paved walkways. Dress for the weather and prepare to be outside for part of the program time. \nSteve Martin is an astronomer and educator who has taught astronomy\, physics and sustainability at colleges\, universities\, and learning centers across the country for over 35 years. He has worked as an instrument specialist for the Hubble Space Telescope and as Observatory Supervisor at Williams College\, where he participated in international research expeditions studying solar eclipses. An engaging speaker and educator\, Steve offers stargazing experiences\, astronomy courses\, and workshops exploring the wonders of the universe\, dark sky science\, and the connections between astronomy\, ecology\, and sustainability. \n●  Pre-registration is required for all classes unless otherwise detailed above. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! Or join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/intro-to-stargazing-jan/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education,BRN
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/pexels-guyjoben-7728833-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
