X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/intermediate-wildflower-embroidery-workshop-jan/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270121T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270121T160000
DTSTAMP:20261120T155820Z
CREATED:20261120T155820Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261120T155820Z
UID:1778780020276-1800532800-1800547200@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Intermediate Wildflower Embroidery Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Intermediate Wildflower Embroidery Workshop\nwith JeanAnn Taylor \nThursday\, January 21  |  12 – 4 pm \nRegister Here!\nThis class will review basic embroidery stitches and techniques\, then learn additional stitches that the student can use in future projects. Using their own materials\, students will be guided through a pre-made pattern to create a beautiful group of flowers in the hoop. Students should bring their own: * 4- or 5-inch embroidery hoop\, * small scissors\, and * needles – Chenille size 24 (be sure to bring this size and style of needle). Other materials will be provided. \nJeanAnn Taylor loves to be creative with words\, watercolors\, hooks\, yarn\, dancing\, gardening\, fabric\, and thread. As an award-winning embroidery artist\, she combines her love of nature with original embroidery designs. \n●  Pre-registration is required for all classes unless otherwise detailed above. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! Or join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/intermediate-wildflower-embroidery-workshop-jan/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Int-Embroidery.jpeg
END:VEVENT
