SUMMARY:The B-Sides
DESCRIPTION:\nThe B-Sides&nbsp\;are a five-piece rock-soul fusion band that
  was born out of late-night jam sessions attheir college rehearsal space w
 ithin the mountains of&nbsp\;Western NC.&nbsp\;Blending the raw energy of&
 nbsp\;rockwith the depth and groove of&nbsp\;soul\, the band has built a s
 ound that’s both electric and heartfelt. Eachof the five members brings 
 their own unique background and influence\, creating a dynamic andsometime
 s quit eclectic mix of style and taste.\n\n\n\nNow stepping beyond the cam
 pus stages of Montreat and into the professional music world\, the\n\n\n\n
 B-Sides are dedicated to carving out their own space. Their music is abou
 t connection\; aboutbringing people together in the same way they were br
 ought together in the first place.Music 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the doo
 r.\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/11/bsides1.jpg
END:VEVENT
