UID:12258@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270130T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270130T233000
DTSTAMP:20261119T015105Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/remedy-tree/
SUMMARY:Remedy Tree
DESCRIPTION:\nRemedy Tree is a Florida-based Americana band rooted in blueg
 rass\, old-time\, and folk traditions. Founded in 2015 by Gabriel and Abig
 ail Acevedo\, the group blends Gabriel’s unique perspective—born in Pu
 erto Rico and raised in rural Florida—with Abigail’s deep old-time bac
 kground. Together with Nathan Beaumont on mandolin and Isaac Taylor on ban
 jo they create original music that feels both timeless and fresh. Since si
 gning with Mountain Fever Records in 2024\, Remedy Tree has performed at I
 reland\, England\, and all over the Eastern US sharing stages with notable
  acts such as Peter Rowan\, The Infamous Stringdusters\, Sister Sadie\, Ri
 cky Skaggs\, and The Steeldrivers. Their 2025 album Beyond What I Can See 
 continues to gain momentum as they headline The Forest Tour in the Summer 
 of 2026. A growing force in Americana music—deep roots\, new ground.\n\n
 \n\nMusic 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the door\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.
 youtube.com/watch?v=MGNTv_22bDk\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/11/remedytree1.webp
END:VEVENT
