DTSTAMP:20261120T104115Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/johnny-mullenax-billy-strings-afterpa
 rty-2/
SUMMARY:Johnny Mullenax
DESCRIPTION:\nKeep the Billy Strings vibes going with Johnny Mullenax in pe
 rson after the show!\n\n\n\nJohnny Mullenax\, a 28-year old Tulsa native\,
  has quickly jumped into the Americana scene in the past year\, creating h
 uge buzz with blistering live performances that are already the stuff of l
 egend\, as part of an extensive headline tour.&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nSaving Countr
 y Music says\, "Every single venue and festival on planet Earth should be 
 moving heaven and Earth to get these dudes on their stage. … Johnny Mull
 enax can't come more highly recommended."&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nBlending rock\, co
 untry\, bluegrass\, blues\, soul into blistering&nbsp\; jams\, Mullenax ta
 kes the Tulsa sound to soaring new heights. Following the well-received 20
 24 EP Friend Like You\, he greeted December 2025 with the brand-new single
 \, “Couple Extra Hours\,” which showed off the virtuosity and joy he b
 rings to his craft. His latest EP\, This Joint’s For You Too\, continues
  that momentum\, with singalongs that get louder as the night gets later.&
 nbsp\;Come join him for a proper party during Billy Strings week!\n\n\n\nM
 usic 10pm-1am $15 cover at the door or buy your ticket ahead of time:https
 ://www.eventbrite.com/e/johnny-mullenax-at-jack-of-the-wood-tickets-200506
 1318378\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q0sQEG8KXBU&amp\;
 list=RDQ0sQEG8KXBU&amp\;start_radio=1\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/11/Johnnymullenax1.jpg
END:VEVENT
