X-SOURCE-ID:jackofthewood_events_ics
X-SOURCE:Jack of the Wood
UID:12265@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270312T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270312T233000
DTSTAMP:20261120T104239Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/the-congdon-griffin-band-3/
SUMMARY:The Congdon Griffin Band
DESCRIPTION:\nThe Congdon Griffin Band plays the incredible original music 
 of Mountain Express "Best of WNC" winners Eric Congdon\, and Hope Griffin.
  This dynamic 5 piece effortlessly blends Rock\, Folk\, and Blues\, with t
 heir unique original sound\, while breathing new life into classic covers.
 \n\n\n\nThe Congdon Griffin Band blends the raw energy of rock 'n' roll\, 
 with the soulful essence of Americana\, and twists it in Folk\, creating a
  musical journey that resonates with heart and grit. Led by the electrifyi
 ng riffs of Eric Congdon and the hauntingly beautiful melodies of Hope Gri
 ffin\, their sound weaves a tapestry of sonic landscapes. The rhythm secti
 on\, anchored by Sam Barker's rock solid bass lines\, the smooth sounds of
  Jackson Dulaney's pedal &amp\; lap steel and Tyler Matthews' dynamic drum
 ming\, propels the band forward with an undeniable groove. Together\, they
  craft a distinct sound that captures the spirit of the open road and the 
 soul of American roots music. The Congdon Griffin Band performs unique ori
 ginals written by Eric &amp\; Hope\, and reimagines classic covers for mus
 ic lovers of all genres.\n\n\n\nMusic 8:30-11:30pm\, $10 cover at the door
 .\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/d_MVvrOARgM?si=-gAJNEwV-COggKQj\n\n\n\n\n\nhtt
 ps://youtu.be/uYBug1QTajI?si=zh8JL6-lcpwOxHRK\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/01/558650791_122216023004104197_4325593861741253806_n-e1772478335850.jpg
END:VEVENT
