DESCRIPTION:Join us on March 20 for an unforgettable day of exploration and
  connection\, designed exclusively for our admitted students. Experience W
 arren Wilson’s unique experiential learning model\, which blends the lib
 eral arts with community engagement and on-campus work.
GEO:35.611409;-82.441422
LOCATION:Warren Wilson College\, Canon Lounge
